From f140fcf3efccddbb3fe8acf2d2c4413ed0fc85c1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Robin Lintermann <rl@karo-electronics.de>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 14:56:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: add the imx95-qs95-5610 module dts and overlays

Upstream-Status: Pending

Add the device tree for the Ka-Ro electronics QS95-5610 solder-in
module (NXP i.MX95) plus overlays for the baseboard peripherals:

- imx95-qs95-cam: IMX219 camera with a 24 MHz fixed clock
- imx95-qs95-copro: Cortex-M7 coprocessor remoteproc (RPMsg vrings,
  vdev buffer, resource table, MU7 mailbox)
- imx95-qs95-enetc0/1-ksz9131: ENETC ports with KSZ9131 RGMII PHYs
- imx95-qs95-lvds-panel: Tianma TM101JVHG32 LVDS panel via SN65DSI83
- imx95-qs95-pcie: M.2 PCIe slot with power regulator
- imx95-qs95-raspi-display: Raspberry Pi 7-inch display (TC358762
  bridge, panel-dpi, EDT-FT5506 touchscreen)

Generated by Mistral Vibe.
Co-Authored-By: Mistral Vibe <vibe@mistral.ai>
